        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#171D19;strokeColor=#3A4A3E;fontColor=#DCE4DA;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;White solid = request path (user waits)&lt;br&gt;Sage = async path (queue → worker)&lt;br&gt;Orange dashed = outside services / webhooks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Requirement → component&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Freshness 15 min → Queue repeatable poll + Worker&lt;br&gt;Freshness 1–2 min → Google push → API → Queue&lt;br&gt;Reliability → Queue retries + dedupe by externalId&lt;br&gt;Correctness → one scheduler job per user in Worker&lt;br&gt;Security → only API touches DB; tokens encrypted&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rule:&lt;/b&gt; the browser never talks to MongoDB." vertex="1">
